  "content": "<img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/HKSjwdn/Living-Things.jpg\" alt=\"Logo\" width=\"1125\" height=\"633\" />\n<br /><br />\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 24px;\">\n    Добавляет различных новых мобов в Minecraft, чтобы сделать мир более живым\n</h3>\n<br />\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/pzC0Why/divider-blue.png\" alt=\"Divider\" width=\"1000\" height=\"10\" /></p>\n<br />\nИнформация о мобах и предметах в игре предоставляется через <strong>Patchouli</strong> (от Vazkii)&nbsp;\n<a title=\"скачать здесь\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/patchouli\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n    скачать здесь\n</a>\n<br />\n(не обязательно, но <strong>настоятельно рекомендуется</strong>)\n<br />\n<br />\n<br />\n\nЭтот мод доступен для Forge, Fabric (начиная с версии 1.18.2) и NeoForge (начиная с версии 1.20.4).\n<br />\n<small>Проверьте вкладку «Версии», чтобы увидеть все версии мода.</small>\n<br />\n<small>Версия для Fabric требует Fabric-API </small>\n<a title=\"получить здесь\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">получить здесь</a>\n\n<br />\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/pzC0Why/divider-blue.png\" alt=\"Divider\" width=\"1000\" height=\"10\" /></p>\n<br />\nПодробную информацию о мобах и предметах можно найти в <strong>викисайте</strong>&nbsp;\n<a title=\"Github\" href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">нажмите здесь</a>\n<br />\n<br />\n<table>\n    <thead align=\"center\">\n        <tr>\n            <td colspan=\"5\"><b>Текущие добавленные мобы (для изображений в игре смотрите галерею)</b></td>\n        </tr>\n    </thead>\n    <tbody align=\"center\">\n        <tr>\n            <td><b><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Elephant\">Слон</a></b></td>\n            <td><b><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Giraffe\">Жираф</a></b></td>\n            <td><b><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Lion\">Лев</a></b></td>\n            <td><b><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Shark\">Акула</a></b></td>\n            <td><b><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Penguin\">Пингвин</a></b></td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td>\n                <a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Elephant\" alt=\"Слон\">\n                    <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/FmTrk3V/x150-elephant.png\" alt=\"Слон\">\n                </a>\n            </td>\n            <td>\n                <a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Giraffe\" alt=\"Жираф\">\n                    <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/zSqZdg1/x150-giraffe-1.png\" alt=\"Жираф\">\n                </a>\n            </td>\n            <td>\n                <a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Lion\" alt=\"Лев\">\n                    <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/Gc5Gv7H/x150-lion.png\" alt=\"Лев\">\n                </a>\n            </td>\n            <td>\n                <a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Shark\" alt=\"Акула\">\n                    <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/TT37Srs/x150-shark.png\" alt=\"Акула\">\n                </a>\n            </td>\n            <td>\n                <a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Penguin\" alt=\"Пингвин\">\n                    <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/3Nsz7QJ/x150-penguin.png\" alt=\"Пингвин\">\n                </a>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td><b><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Ostrich\">Страус</a></b></td>\n            <td><b><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Flamingo\">Фламинго</a></b></td>\n            <td><b><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Crab\">Краб</a></b></td>\n            <td><b><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Mantaray\">Манта</a></b></td>\n            <td><b><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Raccoon\">Енот</a></b></td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td>\n                <a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Ostrich\" alt=\"Страус\">\n                    <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/Hp3pSkb/x150-ostrich.png\" alt=\"Страус\">\n                </a>\n            </td>\n            <td>\n                <a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Flamingo\" alt=\"Фламинго\">\n                    <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/cD25F5X/x150-flamingo.png\" alt=\"Фламинго\">\n                </a>\n            </td>\n            <td>\n                <a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Crab\" alt=\"Краб\">\n                    <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/4jBC2W6/x150-crab-red.png\" alt=\"Краб\">\n                </a>\n            </td>\n            <td>\n                <a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Mantaray\" alt=\"Манта\">\n                    <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/yFdCLY5/x150-mantaray-blue.png\" alt=\"Манта\">\n                </a>\n            </td>\n            <td>\n                <a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Raccoon\" alt=\"Енот\">\n                    <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/603nvTx/x150-raccoon.png\" alt=\"Енот\">\n                </a>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td><b><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Owl\">Сова</a></b></td>\n            <td><b><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Ancient-Blaze\">Древний пламень</a></b>\n            </td>\n            <td><b><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Koala\">Коала</a></b></td>\n            <td><b><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Snail\">Улитка</a></b></td>\n            <td><b><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Monkey\">Обезьяна</a></b></td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td>\n                <a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Owl\" alt=\"Сова\">\n                    <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/PYjzN6N/x150-owl-brown.png\" alt=\"Сова\">\n                </a>\n            </td>\n            <td>\n                <a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Ancient-Blaze\" alt=\"Древний пламень\">\n                    <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/KmFhmKP/x150-ancient-blaze.png\" alt=\"Древний пламень\">\n                </a>\n            </td>\n            <td>\n                <a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Koala\" alt=\"Коала\">\n                    <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/7bjDt6t/x150-koala.png\" alt=\"Коала\">\n                </a>\n            </td>\n            <td>\n                <a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Snail\" alt=\"Улитка\">\n                    <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/3TbdjV6/x150-snail-blue.png\" alt=\"Улитка\">\n                </a>\n            </td>\n            <td>\n                <a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Monkey\" alt=\"Обезьяна\">\n                    <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/FDhLcWf/x150-monkey.png\" alt=\"Обезьяна\">\n                </a>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td><b><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Nether-Knight\">Нижний рыцарь</a></b>\n            </td>\n            <td><b><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Shroomie\">Шруми</a></b></td>\n            <td><b><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Seahorse\">Морской конёк</a></b></td>\n            <td><b><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Baby-Enderdragon\">Малыш эндердрэгон</a></b></td>\n            <td><b><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Peacock\">Павлин</a></b></td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td>\n                <a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Nether-Knight\" alt=\"Нижний рыцарь\">\n                    <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/mChdgsc/x150-nether-knight.png\" alt=\"Нижний рыцарь\">\n                </a>\n            </td>\n            <td>\n                <a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Shroomie\" alt=\"Шруми\">\n                    <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/wRHq7bv/x150-shroomie-red.png\" alt=\"Шруми\">\n                </a>\n            </td>\n            <td>\n                <a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Seahorse\" alt=\"Морской конёк\">\n                    <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/4Ty45xG/x150-seahorse-blue.png\" alt=\"Морской конёк\">\n                </a>\n            </td>\n            <td>\n                <a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Baby-Enderdragon\" alt=\"Малыш эндердрэгон\">\n                    <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/nQdkC9g/x150-baby-ender-dragon.png\" alt=\"Малыш эндердрэгон\">\n                </a>\n            </td>\n            <td>\n                <a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Peacock\" alt=\"Павлин\">\n                    <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/GpKcwTn/x150-peacock.png\" alt=\"Павлин\">\n                </a>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<br />\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/pzC0Why/divider-blue.png\" alt=\"Divider\" width=\"1000\" height=\"10\" /></p>\n<br />\nЕсли у вас есть вопросы по поводу мода или вы хотите узнать больше о предстоящих функциях:\n<br>\nНе стесняйтесь присоединиться к Discord&nbsp;&nbsp;\n<a title=\"discord\" href=\"https://discord.gg/bhUaWhq\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n    <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/VQ66pHN/Discord.png\" alt=\"Divider\" width=\"166\" height=\"32\" />\n</a>\n&nbsp;&nbsp;\n<a title=\"discord\" href=\"https://discord.gg/bhUaWhq\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ссылка</a>",
